# Full Speed Ahead! (jeuno 179): Mapitoto (Upper Jeuno; default 10222 and a script: the default takes the first turn,
# each script talk follows a default talk). A WAR 20 with a Tiger mount item.
# No Chocobo License: nothing (10222); the Tiger item with no Trainer's Whistle: nothing (his trade). The license alone:
# nothing. The license and the Map of the Jeuno Area (GM): 10223 (0, 0, 4); option 0: nothing; option 2: begun (no
# race). Accepted: 10224 (1); options 0 and 2: nothing. The race won (GM: the var 4; the race in Batallia Downs stays
# Lua): 10225 (3055, 15533, Mapitoto's id): the var 0, completed, fame +7 x3, Trainer's Whistle, Raptor Companion.
# Completed: 10226; completed with the var 4 (GM): 10226 all the same. The Tiger item with the whistle (his trade,
# Lua): 10227, its finish takes the item and gives the Tiger Companion.
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-52.8,8.2,85.9 job=WAR lvl=20
item MountTiger
login
trigger Mapitoto                        # the turn: his default 10222
finish
trigger Mapitoto                        # no license: no arm (10222 again)
finish
trade Mapitoto MountTiger x1            # no Trainer's Whistle: nothing (his trade)
keyitem ChocoboLicense
trigger Mapitoto                        # the turn: 10222
finish
trigger Mapitoto                        # the license, no map: no arm
finish
keyitem MapOfTheJeunoArea
trigger Mapitoto                        # the turn: 10222
finish
trigger Mapitoto                        # the license, the map, level 20: 10223 (0, 0, 4)
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Mapitoto                        # the turn: 10222
finish
trigger Mapitoto                        # 10223
finish option=2                         # begun (no race)
trigger Mapitoto                        # the turn: 10222
finish
trigger Mapitoto                        # accepted: 10224 (1)
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Mapitoto                        # the turn: 10222
finish
trigger Mapitoto                        # accepted: 10224 (1)
finish option=2                         # nothing (option 2 begins only on 10223)
charvar [QUEST]FullSpeedAhead 4         # GM: the race won (full_speed_ahead.lua / Batallia Downs stay Lua)
trigger Mapitoto                        # the turn: 10222
finish
trigger Mapitoto                        # the var 4: 10225 (3055, 15533, Mapitoto's id)
finish                                  # the var 0; completed; fame +7 x3; Trainer's Whistle; Raptor Companion
trigger Mapitoto                        # the turn: 10222
finish
trigger Mapitoto                        # completed: 10226
finish
charvar [QUEST]FullSpeedAhead 4         # GM: completed with the var 4
trigger Mapitoto                        # the turn: 10222
finish
trigger Mapitoto                        # completed first: 10226
finish
trade Mapitoto MountTiger x1            # the whistle held (his trade): 10227 (10050, 3055, 2)
finish                                  # the item taken; Tiger Companion
